Hello.

The Chromatic Dragon's historical origins are from the Sumerian deity
Tiamat, a primordial mother goddess who was defeated in battle against
the hero Apsu (later Marduk) and whose body was split to create heaven
and earth. Her in-game form, though, is mostly derived from the D&D
draconic deity Tiamat, who is also known as the "Dragon Queen."  So,
though she is only a minor power in NetHack, I suppose a good degree
of formality and nobility would be expected of her dialogue.

